    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Plots the exact transmission coefficient T(E) of a finite square well vs. incident energy. T(E)=1 exactly whenever k_2 a is a multiple of \pi -- the well becomes perfectly transparent, exactly as observed in low-energy electron scattering off noble-gas atoms.">

