.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Propagates a wavepacket initially localized in the left well of a double well V(x) = \lambda(x^2-a^2)^2 with the real FFT split-operator solver (not the two-level analytic shortcut used in the double-well example), and renders it with animate_density&#x27;s HSV phase coloring: hue tracks the local complex phase \arg\psi(x,t), so the accumulating phase gradient as the packet tunnels back and forth is directly visible, not just the probability density.">

